cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, the duplicate lists or the grouped splits, please cite it as below."
title: "Brain Tumor MRI Leakage Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Code, duplicate and patient-group lists, grouped cross-validation splits and
  per-run results for a leakage- and source-aware benchmark of compact
  transfer-learning CNNs (EfficientNet-B0, ResNet-18, MobileNetV3-Large,
  ShuffleNetV2) for four-class brain-tumour MRI classification on version 2 of
  the Kaggle Brain Tumor MRI Dataset.
type: software
